​Top 3 Rules for Acing Your Interview:
​Research the Company: Know what products or services they offer before walking into the room or joining the video call.
​Use the STAR Method for Behavioral Questions:
​Situation: Describe the context.
​Task: Explain what needed to be done.
​Action: Detail the specific steps you took.
​Result: Share the positive outcome with metrics if possible.
​Ask Smart Questions at the End: Always ask, "What does success look like in the first 30 days in this role?"
